# Testing

- Prefer tests for SafeTensors range reads, canonical addresses, LOD/tile metadata, and scalar equality vs Python reference (`TILE-*`).
- Name cases with requirement IDs when useful (`TILE-07`).
- No network in default unit tests; no large weight downloads without allowlist.
- Do not require GPU/WebGL/Cesium in unit tests.
- Legacy `quatricmorph/` Vitest suites are historical only; they do not define architecture acceptance.
- See `docs/TESTING.md` and root `ARCHITECTURE.md` §18 acceptance criteria.
